{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Build me here seven altars.</b> In order to outweigh the seven altars built by seven righteous men up to Moses: Adam, Abel, Noah, Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, Moses — in order to thereby save the land of seven nations, and corresponding to them he took from his own seven times." "<b>Seven bulls and seven rams.</b> Such is the way of human practice, and also in the Torah we find in several matters, seven and seven."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:22.907917054Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}